# ==============================================================================
# Declarative Group & Gemini Enterprise License Membership CSV Template
# ==============================================================================
# Columns:
#   group_email       : Cloud Identity / Entra group email (or mailNickname prefix)
#   user_email        : User email / UPN (or username prefix on SHARED_IDENTITY_DOMAIN)
#   role              : Cloud Identity group role (MEMBER, MANAGER, OWNER) [default: MEMBER]
#   sync_entra        : Also add user to matching Entra ID Security Group (true/false) [default: true]
#   assign_ge_license : Also assign active Gemini Enterprise license in UserStore (true/false) [default: true]
# ==============================================================================
